{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7e28941-8631-419b-a359-57ef51dbf992",
    "name": "Plant Collection API - UTS Pemrograman Lanjut",
    "description": "Koleksi Postman v2.1 resmi untuk pengujian API Plant Collection.\n\n### Fitur Utama Koleksi:\n1. **Autentikasi Otomatis**: Request `Login` menyimpan token ke variable `token` secara otomatis.\n2. **Dynamic Plant ID**: Request `Create Plant (201 Created)` menyimpan ID tanaman ke variable `plant_id` untuk digunakan pada request GET single, PUT update, dan DELETE.\n3. **Pengujian Status Code Lengkap**:\n   - `200 OK`: Login, Get All, Get By ID, Update, Delete, Logout\n   - `201 Created`: Tambah data plant baru\n   - `401 Unauthorized`: Request endpoint protected tanpa menyertakan Bearer Token, atau kredensial salah\n   - `422 Unprocessable Entity`: Request tambah data plant dengan payload tidak valid / kosong\n\n### Variabel Lingkungan:\n- `base_url`: `http://localhost:8000/api` (direct FrankenPHP) atau `http://localhost/api` (via Nginx reverse proxy)\n- `token`: Bearer token JWT/Sanctum\n- `plant_id`: ID tanaman hasil pembuatan data",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000/api",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "plant_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login - Sukses (200 OK & Save Token)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200 OK\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Response contains bearer token\", function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('token');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.token).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', jsonData.token);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n    \"password\": \"password\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["login"]
            },
            "description": "Login menggunakan akun default seeder (admin@example.com / password). Token Sanctum otomatis disimpan ke variable `token`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login - Gagal Kredensial Salah (401 Unauthorized)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 401 Unauthorized\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Error message is returned\", function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('message');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.message).to.eql(\"Email atau password salah\");",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"wrong.user@example.com\",\n    \"password\": \"invalidpassword\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["login"]
            },
            "description": "Pengujian login dengan email atau password salah, memastikan sistem merespons dengan HTTP 401 Unauthorized."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout (200 OK)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200 OK\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Logout message confirmed\", function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('message');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/logout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["logout"]
            },
            "description": "Mencabut token autentikasi pengguna saat ini."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Error Cases (Skenario Error Soal UTS)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Akses Protected Endpoint Tanpa Token (401 Unauthorized)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 401 Unauthorized\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Response indicates unauthenticated\", function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('message');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.message).to.eql(\"Unauthenticated.\");",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/plants",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["plants"]
            },
            "description": "Mengakses endpoint CRUD Plant tanpa menyertakan header Authorization: Bearer. Memenuhi syarat pengujian 401 Unauthorized."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Plant Validasi Gagal (422 Unprocessable Entity)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 422 Unprocessable Entity\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(422);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Validation error structure returned\", function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('errors');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.errors).to.have.property('name');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.errors).to.have.property('species');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.errors).to.have.property('watering_interval_days');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"notes\": \"Hanya notes tanpa field wajib name, species, dan watering_interval_days\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/plants",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["plants"]
            },
            "description": "Mengirim data kosong / tidak lengkap ke POST /api/plants. Memenuhi syarat pengujian status 422 Unprocessable Entity."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Plant CRUD",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Plant - Tambah Data (201 Created & Save plant_id)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 201 Created\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Plant created with valid ID\", function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('id');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.name).to.eql(\"Monstera Deliciosa\");",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.species).to.eql(\"Monstera deliciosa\");",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('plant_id', jsonData.id);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Monstera Deliciosa\",\n    \"species\": \"Monstera deliciosa\",\n    \"watering_interval_days\": 7,\n    \"notes\": \"Tanaman hias tropis berdaun lebar dan berlubang alami. Siram 7 hari sekali.\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/plants",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["plants"]
            },
            "description": "Menambahkan data tanaman baru dengan payload lengkap dan valid. Mengembalikan status 201 Created dan menyimpan `id` ke variable `plant_id`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get All Plants (200 OK)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200 OK\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Response is an array of plants\", function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.length).to.be.at.least(1);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/plants",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["plants"]
            },
            "description": "Mengambil seluruh daftar tanaman yang tersimpan di database."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Plant by ID (200 OK)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200 OK\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Plant details match plant_id\", function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    var expectedId = pm.collectionVariables.get('plant_id');",
                  "    pm.expect(String(jsonData.id)).to.eql(String(expectedId));",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/plants/{{plant_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["plants", "{{plant_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Mengambil detail satu data tanaman berdasarkan variable `{{plant_id}}`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Plant (200 OK)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200 OK\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Plant data updated successfully\", function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.name).to.eql(\"Monstera Deliciosa (Updated via Postman)\");",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.watering_interval_days).to.eql(10);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Monstera Deliciosa (Updated via Postman)\",\n    \"species\": \"Monstera deliciosa\",\n    \"watering_interval_days\": 10,\n    \"notes\": \"Jadwal penyiraman diubah menjadi 10 hari sekali pada musim penghujan.\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/plants/{{plant_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["plants", "{{plant_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Memperbarui data tanaman yang ditunjuk oleh `{{plant_id}}`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Plant (200 OK)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200 OK\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Plant deleted confirmation message\", function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('message');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.message).to.eql(\"Data dihapus\");",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/plants/{{plant_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["plants", "{{plant_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Menghapus data tanaman yang ditunjuk oleh `{{plant_id}}`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
